### Ruperar todas las peliculas 
GET http://localhost:1234/movies

### Recuperar las peliculas por id 
GET http://localhost:1234/movies/b796e271-121f-11f0-b4d0-94e979c70727

### Recuperar todas las peliculas por genero 
GET http://localhost:1234/movies?genre=action

### Crear una pelicula 
POST http://localhost:1234/movies
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "A ver si es verdad",
    "year": 1994,
    "director": "Frank Darabont",
    "duration": 142,
    "poster": "https://i.ebayimg.com/images/g/4goAAOSwMyBe7hnQ/s-l1200.webp",
    "genre": [
      "Action"
    ],
    "rate": 9.3
}

###Eliminar pelicula
DELETE http://localhost:1234/movies/6d73844d-1294-11f0-b4d0-94e979c70727

###Actualizar una pelicula 
PATCH http://localhost:1234/movies/5db695ac-1294-11f0-b4d0-94e979c70727
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "year": 1950,
    "duration":45
}